SUMMARY:Troll 2 Screening with Live Comedian Commentary for Halloween!
LOCATION:Brooklyn
DESCRIPTION:It’s one of the most infamous horror films ever made. It’s 
 so completely bizarre\, so utterly inexplicable that Scream Scene had to sa
 ve it for Halloween night itself. That’s right\, we’re watching TROLL 2
  Are there trolls in it? No. Is it the sequel to a movie called Troll? Not 
 really. Are we subjecting it to the Die Laughing treatment and grabbing som
 e of NYC’s most entertaining comedians to watch along with us to share th
 eir reactions live? Hell yes. And that’s just the beginning! After the mo
 vie\, stick around at the bar and spend Halloween night partying with your 
 fellow horror fans! Costumes most definitely encouraged. Doors open around 
 6:30\, movie and show begins promptly at 7.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas
